  "discovery": {
    "problem": "Twenty staff upload PDF invoices up to 10 MB, 500 per day in bursts of twenty. Extract supplier/date/total/currency. Three reviewers approve before the existing accounting system receives an idempotent action. Preserve originals and audit history for 90 days in Australia. Uncertain outcomes and poison work must be recoverable. Also preserve and run an independently supplied scientific instrument container image. Its application is externally supplied, not generated by the footprint."
  },
